# Rakdos Joins Up: "Whenever a legendary creature you control dies, Rakdos Joins Up deals damage equal to that creature's power to
# target opponent." Bot2's Wrath of God destroys Bot1's Isamaru (legendary, power 2), Tyrox (legendary, power 4) and Memnite (not
# legendary) and Bot2's own Isamaru (legendary, but not Bot1's) together: Rakdos Joins Up, an enchantment, stays. It triggers once
# for Isamaru and once for Tyrox only (CR 700.4, 603.10a), 2 and 4 damage to Bot2, who ends on 14. The graveyard has no creature card
# when Rakdos enters, so its first ability has no target and leaves the stack (CR 603.3d).

